    {"id":"chr-fc-238a","category":"shop-or-inn","translation":"抱歉，你的钱好像不够。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-250c","category":"dynamic-template","translation":"<FD>正紧紧勒住你的身体！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2520","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"被诅咒的人啊，滚出去！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2532","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"我正在寻找地下室。听说它就在城堡的某个地方……","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-254d","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"要打开门，需要钥匙。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2562","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"请与魔物战斗，积累经验。这样勇者的等级就会不断提升，逐渐变强。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-25a0","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"只要有复活咒文，就能以听到咒文时的状态重新醒来。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-25f2","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"这里从前曾是乐园，后来却被魔物们……","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2611","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"让我们为勇者祈祷。愿光明与你同在。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2637","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"如果对自己的体力有信心，就进去吧。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-264e","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"我们是旅行商人。许多同伴都被魔物杀害了。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2675","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"听说有些城镇已经被魔物毁灭了。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2692","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"加莱之墓就在加莱镇。进入镇里，推开黑暗中的墙壁吧。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2748","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"听说某处有一座出售魔法钥匙的城镇。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2764","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"听说加莱之墓里藏着银竖琴。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2770","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"请从那里凹进去的地方向里面走。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-27e4","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"从这座城镇一直向北，再沿海岸向西走，听说那里有加莱镇。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-282e","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"战斗积累经验、等级提升后，就去见国王吧。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2855","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"你就是继承洛特血脉的人？有什么证据吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-286c","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"从拉达托姆城堡南边，可以看见海对岸的一座城堡。听说龙王就在那里。噢，真可怕……","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-28a9","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"这里是露天浴池。功效是治疗风湿。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-28d1","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"听说在麦拉遥远的东方，有一座出售优秀武器的城镇。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2904","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"我是悠帝，正在寻找米亚公。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-291e","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"南方的岛非常可怕。如果没有充分增强实力，恐怕无法活着回来。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2980","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"古老传说中，妖精们曾让巨像沉睡。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-299e","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"竖琴会招来魔物。不要靠近加莱之墓！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-29b9","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"我很忙，去问旁边那个人吧。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-29d3","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"算了，拿去吧！小偷！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2a0b","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"我最讨厌男人了。走开，走开！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2a1f","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"听说某个地方藏着勇者洛特曾穿过的铠甲。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2a36","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"听说萝拉公主被关在某处的洞窟里。她已经获救了吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2a66","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"我是宫王，正在寻找米亚公。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2a80","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"古老传说中，伟大的吟游诗人加莱建造了这座城镇。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2aa6","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"欢迎来到传说之城加莱！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2ab9","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"我听说了！掳走公主的魔物竟然朝东方飞去了！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2afa","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"如果你想寻找印记，就去拜访住在这座城镇神殿里的长老。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2b23","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"古老传说中，勇者洛特使用的剑甚至能斩断钢铁。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2b56","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"今晚做什么菜好呢……","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2bab","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"以前我爷爷常说，他的朋友雪之夫似乎在自己店铺后面的树下埋了什么东西。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2bec","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"听说洛特铠甲在人们手中辗转流传，最后到了一个叫雪之夫的男人手里。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2c17","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"听说我家过去在麦拉镇经营商店。店铺位于城镇东边；雪之夫爷爷在世时，城镇遭到魔物袭击，于是逃到了这里。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2c7b","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"你是谁？再不出去，我就叫人了！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2c93","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"我是春。我在等她。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2cc7","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"古老传说中，洛特曾在这座岛的最西端架起彩虹；又从魔王房间隐藏的入口进入黑暗。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2d10","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"听说拉达托姆城堡里有太阳石。你已经拿到了吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2d4e","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"哟，{PLAYER_NAME}！这不是{PLAYER_NAME}吗！好久不见。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2da6","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"不要去南方。听说那里住着强大得多的魔物。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2dd1","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"这个世界上真的有能够刺穿龙王身体的剑吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2df8","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"春大人真是的，怎么这么晚……哼，哼。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2e12","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"许多勇者从城镇出发远行，然后死去了。勇者{PLAYER_NAME}，我不希望你也死去。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2e51","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"你去过南方的岛吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2e63","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"据说龙王的爪能撕裂钢铁，吐出的火焰甚至能熔化岩石。{PLAYER_NAME}，即便如此你也要去吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2ea0","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"这里是预言所。你找到神圣祠堂了吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2ee0","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"什么！听说那里有非常强大的魔物……","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2f09","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"这里是雨与太阳交汇的祠堂。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2f12","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"它原本由吉利恩保管，但他声称要去里姆尔达尔，离开村子后就再也没有回来。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2f3b","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"听说南方有一座叫里姆尔达尔的城镇。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2f4d","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"这样就好。没有人会说你是胆小鬼。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2f78","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"啊，萝拉公主究竟在哪里……","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2f96","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"啊，我深爱的萝拉公主……我恨{PLAYER_NAME}。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2fad","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"请转告国王，搜寻萝拉公主的队伍已经全军覆没。我也不行了……呃……","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2fda","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"是谁在碰我？我已经什么也看不见，什么也听不见了……","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3011","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"公主被魔物掳走已经半年。国王虽然什么也没说，内心一定十分痛苦。{PLAYER_NAME}，请救出公主！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3069","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"我一直等待像你这样的年轻人出现。这里应该已经没有你的事了，去吧。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-30d1","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"继承洛特血脉的勇者啊！但以你现在的武器还无法打倒龙王！以后再来吧！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-30fc","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"终于拿到了啊，勇者{PLAYER_NAME}！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3134","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"噢，神明啊！愿光明照耀传说中的勇者{PLAYER_NAME}！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-314d","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"去吧，然后寻找吧。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3181","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"我想确认你是否是真正的勇者。听说这片土地的某处有能召来魔物的银竖琴。把它带回来，我便承认你是勇者，并赐予你雨云杖。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-31d4","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"噢，{PLAYER_NAME}！你带来竖琴了！如果你真是继承洛特血脉的勇者，应该持有印记。愚蠢之人，退下！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3216","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"继承洛特血脉的人啊！如今正是雨与太阳交汇之时！我把彩虹水滴赐予你！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-32ac","category":"story-or-ending","translation":"噢，{PLAYER_NAME}！感谢你救出了公主，我由衷向你致谢！来，萝拉，到我身边。萝拉：请等一下。我想送给{PLAYER_NAME}大人一件礼物。请收下我爱慕您的心意。也请您送给我一样东西，把<FD>送给萝拉吧。啊！即使相隔两地，萝拉也永远与你同在。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-33c1","category":"dynamic-template","translation":"噢，{PLAYER_NAME}！你平安回来了，我非常高兴。升到下一级还需要<F3>点经验。我来告诉你复活咒文，请把它记录下来。那么，下次再见，勇者{PLAYER_NAME}！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3470","category":"story-or-ending","translation":"欢迎你，{PLAYER_NAME}。我就是王中之王——龙王。如果你愿意成为我的同伴，我就把世界的一半送给你。怎么样？愿意成为我的同伴吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-34de","category":"story-or-ending","translation":"那么，就把世界的一半——黑暗世界赐给你！然后……你的旅程结束了。好好休息吧！哇哈哈哈哈！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-35b2","category":"system-or-unknown","translation":"从王座后方感觉到一阵风。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3a1d","category":"story-or-ending","translation":"石板上写着：我的名字是洛特。继承我血脉的人啊，要渡过从拉达托姆望见的魔之岛，需要三件物品。我集齐它们，渡海打倒了魔王。如今我把三件圣物托付给三位贤者，他们的后代会继续守护。当邪恶再次在魔之岛复苏时，集齐它们并战斗吧。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3b95","category":"system-or-unknown","translation":"噢，{PLAYER_NAME}！竟然死掉了，成何体统！真拿你没办法，再给你一次机会。战斗受伤后要回城住旅店恢复。希望这种事不要再次发生。力量提升了<F3>！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3cad","category":"system-or-unknown","translation":"噢，{PLAYER_NAME}！竟然死掉了，成何体统！而且还中了诅咒。被诅咒的人啊，滚出去！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3cfa","category":"story-or-ending","translation":"噢，{PLAYER_NAME}！你终于回来了，我非常高兴。等级提升时要来见我。龙王显出了真身！！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3dae","category":"story-or-ending","translation":"噢，{PLAYER_NAME}！一切都和古老传说完全相同！你正是继承勇者洛特血脉的人，也是最适合统治这个世界的人。愿意代替我治理这个国家吗？然而{PLAYER_NAME}回答：不。如果有一个由我统治的国家，我希望亲自去寻找它。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2140","category":"system-or-unknown","translation":"这里没有楼梯。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-214f","category":"system-or-unknown","translation":"不能从这里进入。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-233e","category":"shop-or-inn","translation":"这样可以吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-23e8","category":"system-or-unknown","translation":"MP不足。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-23f4","category":"system-or-unknown","translation":"但是什么也没有发生。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2448","category":"item-spell-action","translation":"这里不能使用奇美拉之翼。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3178","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"这是一个古老传说。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2067","category":"item-spell-action","translation":"{PLAYER_NAME}把彩虹水滴高举向天空。然而这里没有架起彩虹。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2100","category":"shop-or-inn","translation":"欢迎来到旅人旅店。住一晚需要<F3>金币，要住宿吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-217e","category":"shop-or-inn","translation":"可以买一瓶驱除魔物的圣水，价格是38金币。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-21fa","category":"shop-or-inn","translation":"要不要一把能打开任何门的魔法钥匙？一把<F3>金币，怎么样？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2277","category":"shop-or-inn","translation":"您要卖<FD>吧？那么我出<F3>金币收购，可以吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2368","category":"shop-or-inn","translation":"那么，你现在使用的<FD>，我出<F3>金币收购。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2402","category":"item-spell-action","translation":"咒文的效果消失了。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-24c1","category":"item-spell-action","translation":"{PLAYER_NAME}紧紧握住了<FD>。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-24de","category":"item-spell-action","translation":"{PLAYER_NAME}装备了<FD>。<FD>紧紧勒住你的身体，你受到了诅咒。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2688","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"欢迎来到拉达托姆城堡！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-27ae","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"欢迎来到拉达托姆镇！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-280f","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"不，我不是萝拉公主。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-28f1","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"听说里姆尔达尔有一家卖钥匙的店。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-295c","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"听说巨像害怕笛声。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2974","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"这里是麦拉村。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-29e4","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"遥远的南方曾有一座麦拉镇。它现在还存在吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2b44","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"欢迎来到要塞都市梅尔基德！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2b6e","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"喂，用我的猫和你的《勇者斗恶龙》交换吧。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2b93","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"嗯，我就是迷路的米亚公。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2d25","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"欢迎来到里姆尔达尔镇！来吧，少爷。如果想休息，费用是5金币。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2d68","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"我是吉利恩。从麦拉的浴池向南走四步，调查那里吧。","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2d8e","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"不久这座城镇也会被魔物……啊，神明啊……","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-2ed0","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"去梅尔基德吧！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-315a","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"从拉达托姆城堡向北70步、向西40步，就是那个地方！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3245","category":"story-or-ending","translation":"萝拉：竟然真的有人来救我，我仍不敢相信！我是国王的女儿萝拉。怎么能这样……你把公主抱了起来。萝拉：我好高兴……","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3384","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"萝拉：{PLAYER_NAME}大人会想念萝拉吗？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-344a","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"萝拉：你会把我带回城堡吧？","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-36e2","category":"battle","translation":"那个不能用于战斗！但是咒文被封住了！但是咒文没有生效！使<FD>睡着了！封住了<FD>的咒文！打倒了<FD>！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-375b","category":"battle","translation":"{PLAYER_NAME}的等级提升了！学会了一个咒文！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3776","category":"battle","translation":"巨像静静闭上眼睛，睡着了！<FD>看起来很高兴！{PLAYER_NAME}逃跑了！但被挡住了去路！{PLAYER_NAME}使用了药草！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3afc","category":"battle","translation":"会心一击！！听见萝拉公主的声音。萝拉：您的等级已经达到最高。{PLAYER_NAME}睡着了！{PLAYER_NAME}正在睡觉……{PLAYER_NAME}醒来了！<FD>的伤势恢复了！<FD>迅速闪开了！这里没有门！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3b88","category":"system-or-unknown","translation":"没有钥匙！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3c7b","category":"dynamic-template","translation":"升到下一级还需要<F3>点经验。那么，出发吧，{PLAYER_NAME}！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3e4d","category":"npc-dialogue","translation":"萝拉：请等一下！","translationStatus":"draft"},
    {"id":"chr-fc-3e57","category":"story-or-ending","translation":"萝拉：我也想陪伴你继续旅行。你会带上萝拉一起走吧？","translationStatus":"draft"}
  ]
}
